<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Familia Massawe</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont@latest/dist/tabler-icons.min.css">
<style>
  :root {
    --green: #1D9E75;
    --green-light: #E1F5EE;
    --green-dark: #085041;
    --amber: #BA7517;
    --amber-light: #FAEEDA;
    --purple: #534AB7;
    --purple-light: #EEEDFE;
    --teal: #0F6E56;
    --coral: #D85A30;
    --bg: #f8faf9;
    --card: #ffffff;
    --text: #1a1a1a;
    --text2: #5a5a5a;
    --text3: #9a9a9a;
    --border: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    --radius: 14px;
    --radius-sm: 8px;
    --shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    max-width: 430px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ===== TOP HEADER ===== */
  .top-bar {
    background: var(--green-dark);
    color: white;
    padding: 16px 20px 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
  }
  .top-bar h1 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; }
  .top-bar .subtitle { font-size: 12px; opacity: 0.7; }
  .admin-badge {
    background: var(--amber);
    color: white;
    font-size: 11px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  /* ===== MAIN CONTENT ===== */
  .page { display: none; padding: 16px 16px 100px; }
  .page.active { display: block; }

  /* ===== BOTTOM NAV ===== */
  .bottom-nav {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 430px;
    background: white;
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 0 20px;
    z-index: 200;
  }
  .nav-item {
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    cursor: pointer;
    padding: 6px 0;
    color: var(--text3);
    font-size: 10px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-item.active { color: var(--green); }
  .nav-item i { font-size: 22px; }
  .nav-more { position: relative; }
  .more-menu {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 70px;
    right: 10px;
    background: white;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
    display: none;
    min-width: 160px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .more-menu.open { display: block; }
  .more-item {
    padding: 14px 18px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
  }
  .more-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .more-item:hover { background: var(--green-light); }
  .more-item i { color: var(--green); font-size: 18px; }

  /* ===== CARDS ===== */
  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .card-title {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text2);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  /* ===== DASHBOARD ===== */
  .hero-card {
    background: var(--green-dark);
    color: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 24px 20px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -30px; right: -30px;
    width: 140px; height: 140px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  }
  .hero-tree { font-size: 52px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .hero-card h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .hero-card p { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.75; }

  .stats-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .stat-card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .stat-num { font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--green); }
  .stat-label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--text3); margin-top: 2px; }

  .gen-timeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
  .gen-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .gen-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .gen-dot {
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .gen-info { flex: 1; }
  .gen-info h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .gen-info p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text3); }
  .gen-count { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text2); }

  /* ===== FAMILY TREE ===== */
  .tree-header { text-align: center; padding: 8px 0 16px; }
  .tree-header p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--text3); margin-top: 4px; }

  .tree-node {
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .node-box {
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    background: white;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .node-box:hover { border-color: var(--green); }
  .node-box.root { border-color: var(--green-dark); background: var(--green-light); }
  .node-box.expanded { border-color: var(--green); }
  .avatar {
    width: 38px; height: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .avatar.male { background: #E6F1FB; color: #185FA5; }
  .avatar.female { background: #FBEAF0; color: #993556; }
  .avatar.root { background: var(--green-dark); color: white; }
  .node-info { flex: 1; }
  .node-info h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .node-info p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text3); }
  .node-arrow { color: var(--text3); font-size: 18px; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .node-arrow.down { transform: rotate(90deg); }

  .children-container {
    display: none;
    margin-left: 24px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    border-left: 2px dashed var(--border);
    margin-top: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .children-container.open { display: block; }

  /* ===== MEMBER LIST ===== */
  .search-box {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 11px 14px 11px 40px;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 14px;
    background: white;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    position: relative;
  }
  .search-wrap { position: relative; }
  .search-wrap i {
    position: absolute;
    left: 12px; top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    color: var(--text3);
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .member-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .member-item:hover { border-color: var(--green); }
  .member-info { flex: 1; }
  .member-info h4 { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; }
  .member-info p { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text3); }
  .member-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .btn-icon {
    width: 32px; height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    background: white;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--text2);
  }
  .btn-icon:hover { background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); }

  /* ===== PROFILE PAGE ===== */
  .profile-hero {
    background: var(--green-dark);
    padding: 24px 20px 32px;
    text-align: center;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 0 0 24px 24px;
    margin: -16px -16px 0;
  }
  .profile-avatar {
    width: 80px; height: 80px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 auto 12px;
    border: 3px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
  }
  .profile-hero h2 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; }
  .profile-hero p { font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.75; margin-top: 4px; }
  .info-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 12px 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .info-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .info-row i { color: var(--green); font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .info-label { color: var(--text3); font-size: 12px; }
  .info-val { font-weight: 500; }
  .family-link {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--green-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--green-dark);
  }
  .family-link i { font-size: 18px; }

  /* ===== PICHA ===== */
  .photo-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
  .photo-item {
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    background: var(--green-light);
    position: relative;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .photo-item img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .photo-placeholder {
    width: 100%; height: 100%;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: var(--green);
    font-size: 12px; gap: 6px;
  }
  .photo-placeholder i { font-size: 28px; }
  .upload-btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    border: 1.5px dashed var(--green);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--green-light);
    color: var(--green-dark);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }

  /* ===== HISTORIA ===== */
  .historia-section { margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .historia-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .historia-header h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; }
  .edit-btn {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px;
    font-size: 12px; color: var(--green);
    cursor: pointer; padding: 4px 8px;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--green);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
  .historia-text { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text2); line-height: 1.7; }
  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .timeline-year {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--green);
    min-width: 45px;
    padding-top: 1px;
  }
  .timeline-dot {
    width: 8px; height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
    margin-top: 6px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .timeline-content { flex: 1; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text2); }

  /* ===== MODAL ===== */
  .modal-overlay {
    display: none;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    z-index: 300;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .modal-overlay.open { display: flex; }
  .modal {
    background: white;
    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
    padding: 24px 20px 40px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 430px;
    max-height: 85vh;
    overflow-y: auto;
  }
  .modal-handle {
    width: 40px; height: 4px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 2px;
    margin: 0 auto 20px;
  }
  .modal h3 { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; }

  .field { margin-bottom: 14px; }
  .field label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text3); display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
  .field input, .field select, .field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 11px 14px;
    border: 0.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 14px;
    background: white;
    color: var(--text);
    outline: none;
  }
  .field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus {
    border-color: var(--green);
  }
  .field textarea { height: 80px; resize: none; }

  .btn {
    width: 100%;
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .btn-primary { background: var(--green-dark); color: white; }
  .btn-secondary { background: white; color: var(--text); border: 0.5px solid var(--border); }

  .gender-btns { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .gender-btn {
    flex: 1; padding: 10px;
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: white;
    font-size: 13px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .gender-btn.active { border-color: var(--green); background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green-dark); font-weight: 600; }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .back-btn {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    color: var(--green);
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .back-btn i { font-size: 20px; }

  .tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-right: 6px;
  }
  .tag-gen1 { background: var(--green-light); color: var(--green-dark); }
  .tag-gen2 { background: var(--amber-light); color: #633806; }
  .tag-gen3 { background: var(--purple-light); color: var(--purple); }
  .tag-gen4 { background: #FBEAF0; color: #993556; }

  .empty-state {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    color: var(--text3);
  }
  .empty-state i { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
  .empty-state p { font-size: 14px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- TOP BAR -->
<div class="top-bar">
  <div>
    <div class="top-bar h1">🌳 Familia Massawe</div>
    <div class="subtitle">Ukoo wa Massawe</div>
  </div>
  <div class="admin-badge" onclick="showAdminLogin()">
    <i class="ti ti-shield-check"></i> Admin
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== PAGE: HOME ===== -->
<div class="page active" id="page-home">

  <div class="hero-card">
    <div class="hero-tree">🌳</div>
    <h2>Karibu, Familia Massawe</h2>
    <p>Ukoo wetu una historia ndefu ya upendo, mshikamano na utamaduni wa kizazi hadi kizazi.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="stats-grid">
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-num" id="stat-wanafamilia">0</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Wanafamilia</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-num">4</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Vizazi</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-num" id="stat-vijiji">3</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Mababu Wakuu</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="stat-num">1950</div>
      <div class="stat-label">Mwaka Msingi</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title"><i class="ti ti-users"></i> Vizazi vya Ukoo</div>
    <div class="gen-timeline">
      <div class="gen-row" onclick="goPage('page-tree')">
        <div class="gen-dot" style="background:#E1F5EE;color:#085041;font-size:11px;">1</div>
        <div class="gen-info">
          <h4>Babu Mkuu wa Massawe</h4>
          <p>Mzizi wa ukoo wetu wote</p>
        </div>
        <span class="gen-count">1</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gen-row" onclick="goPage('page-tree')">
        <div class="gen-dot" style="background:#FAEEDA;color:#633806;font-size:11px;">2</div>
        <div class="gen-info">
          <h4>Kizazi cha Pili</h4>
          <p>Watoto wa babu mkuu</p>
        </div>
        <span class="gen-count" id="cnt-gen2">3</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gen-row" onclick="goPage('page-tree')">
        <div class="gen-dot" style="background:#EEEDFE;color:#534AB7;font-size:11px;">3</div>
        <div class="gen-info">
          <h4>Kizazi cha Tatu</h4>
          <p>Wajukuu</p>
        </div>
        <span class="gen-count" id="cnt-gen3">0</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gen-row" onclick="goPage('page-tree')">
        <div class="gen-dot" style="background:#FBEAF0;color:#993556;font-size:11px;">4</div>
        <div class="gen-info">
          <h4>Kizazi cha Nne</h4>
          <p>Vitukuu</p>
        </div>
        <span class="gen-count" id="cnt-gen4">0</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title"><i class="ti ti-sparkles"></i> Muhtasari wa Historia</div>
    <div class="historia-text" id="historia-muhtasari">Familia ya Massawe ilianzishwa zaidi ya miaka saba ya kumi iliyopita. Babu mkuu alikuwa mkulima hodari na kiongozi wa hekima katika jamii yake, aliyejenga msingi imara wa upendo na mshikamano kwa vizazi vyake.</div>
  </div>

</div>

<!-- ===== PAGE: TREE ===== -->
<div class="page" id="page-tree">
  <div class="tree-header">
    <div class="section-title" style="justify-content:center;"><i class="ti ti-git-branch"></i> Mti wa Ukoo</div>
    <p>Bonyeza jina kuona uzao wake</p>
  </div>
  <div id="tree-container"></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== PAGE: WANAFAMILIA ===== -->
<div class="page" id="page-wanafamilia">
  <div class="section-title"><i class="ti ti-users"></i> Wanafamilia</div>
  <div class="search-wrap">
    <i class="ti ti-search"></i>
    <input type="text" class="search-box" placeholder="Tafuta mwanafamilia..." oninput="filterMembers(this.value)">
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:14px;">
    <button class="btn btn-primary" style="width:auto;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;" onclick="openAddMember()">
      <i class="ti ti-plus"></i> Ongeza
    </button>
  </div>
  <div id="members-list"></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== PAGE: PROFILE ===== -->
<div class="page" id="page-profile">
  <div class="back-btn" onclick="goBack()"><i class="ti ti-arrow-left"></i> Rudi</div>
  <div id="profile-content"></div>
</div>

<!-- ===== PAGE: PICHA ===== -->
<div class="page" id="page-picha">
  <div class="section-title"><i class="ti ti-photo"></i> Picha za Familia</div>
  <label class="upload-btn">
    <i class="ti ti-upload"></i> Pakia Picha Mpya
    <input type="file" accept="image/*" style="display:none" onchange="addPhoto(this)">
  </label>
  <div class="photo-grid" id="photo-grid">
    <div class="photo-item">
      <div class="photo-placeholder"><i class="ti ti-photo"></i><span>Picha za harusi</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="photo-item">
      <div class="photo-placeholder"><i class="ti ti-users"></i><span>Familia yote</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- ===== PAGE: HISTORIA ===== -->
<div class="page" id="page-historia">
  <div class="section-title"><i class="ti ti-book"></i> Historia ya Familia</div>

  <div class="historia-section">
    <div class="historia-header">
      <h3>🏡 Asili Yetu</h3>
      <div class="edit-btn" onclick="editHistoria('asili')"><i class="ti ti-edit"></i> Hariri</div>
    </div>
    <div class="historia-text" id="hist-asili">Familia yetu ilianza miaka mingi iliyopita. Babu mkuu Massawe alikuwa mkulima hodari na kiongozi wa hekima katika jamii yake. Aliishi kwa amani na upendo na kuwalea watoto wake kwa thamani za juu za utu na utamaduni.</div>
  </div>

  <div class="historia-section">
    <div class="historia-header">
      <h3>📅 Tarehe Muhimu</h3>
      <div class="edit-btn" onclick="openAddTimeline()"><i class="ti ti-plus"></i> Ongeza</div>
    </div>
    <div id="timeline-list"></div>
